WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
You can refuse anything that is unreasonable

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,700
This will be written into the contract

3
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,000
We are a very formal company

4
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,300
The company's profits rank first in the world

5
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:06,900
An annual salary of one million is very common.

6
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,400
So don't have any worries

7
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:12,780
Boss, you are so kind to me

8
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:14,580
Luo Wei was hired by force, right?

9
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:16,180
How much is the confidential salary?

10
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,180
Thirty thousand or fifty thousand?

11
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,080
You don’t know how rich your boss is

12
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,280
How sentimental

13
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,280
I said a monthly salary of 50,000

14
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:22,480
He actually said too little

15
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,080
Must be added to one million per year

16
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:27,080
Are you joking? It's absolutely true that Zhao Qian knows secrets.

17
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:30,380
A beautiful anchor named Liucici earns three million a year as an auctioneer.

18
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:31,380
I want to try it too

19
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:32,380
Do you think I can succeed?

20
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,080
You don't even care about thin flowers, right?

21
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:36,680
What happened to the nine fine flowers that were eliminated just now?

22
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:37,680
Luo Wei was hired by force

23
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:38,780
And an annual salary of one million

24
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:42,580
Zhao Qian also has an annual salary of three million. If you know the secrets, you must be able to help.

25
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:44,180
I can hardly live anymore

26
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:45,780
Our company is recruiting front desk and clerks

27
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,180
Basically, they are chosen based on appearance.

28
00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:49,680
Now there are so many flowers in the clouds of laughter that I can't help you.

29
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:51,880
Secretary Zhao, please

30
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,380
I can only give you a hint

31
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:54,560
The boss and HR person responsible for the interview
